  "body": "Lathe programs on the field stock simulation (#19).\n\n**What changed**\n- `plan_program` no longer refuses turning: each turning op's plan carries the insert's nose radius and the op's lathe axis, fitted the way the generator fits it (`operation::source_facets`).\n- The revolved-stadium sweep turns about a stated axis (`LatheAxis`, `crates/sim/src/stock_sim/field_lathe.rs`, `Stock::simulate_lathe_about`); `simulate_lathe` still means world Z. A parting move past the centre reads as the segment it is.\n- The viewport field (`stock_view`) and playback (`stock_play`) route turning ops through the sweep; a turning op's plan radius is its nose radius (0.5 mm cell instead of 1.1 mm).\n- Still refused by name: grooving/parting blades, thread inserts and form gauges (`LATHE_BLADE_REFUSAL`, waits for #21); the height verdict (`simulate_document`) refuses lathe programs (`LATHE_VERDICT_REFUSAL`), so the post gate still says \"not judged\".\n- Rapids cut nothing on the field (as for mill ops); rapid collisions stay with the generation-time rapid check.\n\n**Meridian parity** (debug, 0.5 mm cell, every cell centre two cells inside the stock, vs an independent meridian law)\n\n| Op | Cells checked | Cut | Sign misses |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Facing | 438,976 | 10,680 | 0 |\n| Facing, bar off the origin (3, -2) | 438,976 | 10,680 | 0 |\n| Profile rough + finish | 438,976 | 11,992 | 0 |\n| Multi-pass contour | 438,976 | 9,160 | 0 |\n| Boring | 429,777 | 2,904 | 0 |\n\n**Pinned by** `lathe_field_sim::{facing_simulates_on_the_field_with_meridian_parity, a_bar_off_the_origin_is_turned_about_its_own_fitted_axis, profile_rough_and_finish_simulate_with_meridian_parity, multi_pass_contour_simulates_with_meridian_parity, boring_simulates_inside_the_bore_with_meridian_parity, a_grooving_blade_is_refused_by_name_and_the_verdict_refuses_the_lathe}` and `stock_lathe::a_stated_axis_off_the_origin_cuts_the_same_meridian` (with NaN move / zero or NaN axis refusals).\n\n**Gates**: quick gate green against origin/main (sim, motion, app); the agent ran camcraft-sim, 17 app suites one by one, clippy `-D warnings`, `cargo check -p camcraft-ui` - all green.\n\n**Known**: `backend.rs` (450 lines, +12) and `field_cut.rs` (443, down from 462) were already over 400 lines; not split here.\n\nChangelog: feat(sim,app): turning programs (facing, profile, contour, boring) simulate on the field stock view about their fitted spindle with meridian parity; blade/thread/form tools refuse by name\n\nFixes #19\n",
